WEBVTT

00:05.797 --> 00:07.173
Thanks for shopping with us!

01:42.977 --> 01:43.812
SAKAMOTO'S

01:43.895 --> 01:46.397
Man, Mr. Sakamoto,
you were so cool the other day!

01:46.481 --> 01:47.565
VS. SON HEE AND BACHO

01:47.649 --> 01:50.235
That close-quarters combat was insane!

01:50.318 --> 01:51.736
Never seen anything like it!

01:51.820 --> 01:55.323
Even retired,
you're the absolute best for sure!

01:55.406 --> 01:58.034
Bam, bam, and then a counterpunch!

01:58.118 --> 01:58.952
<i>Get back to work.</i>

01:59.035 --> 02:01.621
And most of them
you killed with a single blow!

02:01.704 --> 02:02.539
What's that?

02:03.248 --> 02:04.249
"Killed"?

02:05.041 --> 02:06.084
Honey,

02:06.167 --> 02:09.295
you aren't going back to being a hit man,
are you?

02:12.298 --> 02:14.968
But you killed all those guys,
just the other day.

02:15.051 --> 02:16.511
Made sure it wasn't fatal.

02:16.594 --> 02:19.806
Honey, do I need to remind you

02:20.682 --> 02:23.643
that I will file for divorce
if you break our family rule?

02:23.726 --> 02:25.812
Divorce!

02:30.233 --> 02:31.943
Good, I was just checking.

02:32.443 --> 02:34.571
I'm going to go sweep outside.

02:37.699 --> 02:40.034
So, what's this about a "family rule"?

02:43.746 --> 02:46.833
You have to stop killing me in your mind!

02:46.916 --> 02:48.835
<i>Keep your mouth shut.</i>

02:49.544 --> 02:50.795
NIIKITA CHINATOWN

02:52.380 --> 02:56.050
So this is Niikita Chinatown!

02:56.134 --> 02:57.635
There's so much to see!

02:58.428 --> 03:02.432
But why'd we come all the way here
to buy items for the shop?

03:05.226 --> 03:06.436
Thanks, come again!

03:08.229 --> 03:10.231
<i>Only 50 per day!</i>

03:10.315 --> 03:11.482
"Heavenly Pork Buns"?

03:11.566 --> 03:13.693
Is this what you came here for?

03:13.776 --> 03:16.154
<i>Got enough for Aoi and Hana, too.</i>

03:21.117 --> 03:24.871
<i>He loves his family so much!</i>

03:24.954 --> 03:28.791
By the way, what was that "family rule"
Ms. Aoi was talking about?

03:28.875 --> 03:29.751
<i>Drop it.</i>

03:29.834 --> 03:31.794
No need to explain, just think about it!

03:31.878 --> 03:33.338
And I'll take a peek!

03:34.756 --> 03:36.758
Get out of my way!

03:40.386 --> 03:41.554
Mr. Sakamoto!

03:44.265 --> 03:45.767
HEAVENLY PORK BUNS

03:47.185 --> 03:49.062
Oh no, the Heavenly Pork Buns!

03:50.146 --> 03:52.232
If we brush the dirt off, maybe we can...

03:53.358 --> 03:54.734
Maybe not.

03:55.235 --> 03:56.277
There she is!

03:56.361 --> 03:58.363
- You bitch!
- Get her!

04:00.531 --> 04:02.575
MYSTERY GIRL
LU SHAOTANG

04:02.659 --> 04:05.954
Think you can shake us
sneaking through alleys like a cat?

04:06.037 --> 04:08.831
As if I'd get caught
by a bunch of dummies like you!

04:08.915 --> 04:12.919
Mr. Sakamoto?
We might want to leave before things...

04:13.544 --> 04:14.796
<i>They're ruined.</i>

04:18.841 --> 04:21.636
Sorry, this is no time
to be worrying about that!

04:29.269 --> 04:31.312
<i>Wow, she's using tai chi!</i>

04:31.396 --> 04:32.772
Surround her!

04:42.365 --> 04:43.199
You little--

04:49.789 --> 04:51.916
I've got you now.

04:52.000 --> 04:54.127
Hey! Let go of me!

04:56.504 --> 04:58.381
Keep her alive, but mess her up good.

05:00.216 --> 05:02.427
Let's get those legs first,
so you can't run away.

05:10.685 --> 05:12.603
Who the hell is this guy?

05:17.233 --> 05:19.819
Freeze! Not another step!

05:19.902 --> 05:21.529
- No!
- I'll kill--

05:37.545 --> 05:39.839
<i>What's her story?</i>

05:39.922 --> 05:41.716
Look, there she is!

05:41.799 --> 05:44.177
She's with her gang! Get 'em all!

05:44.260 --> 05:45.887
"Her gang"?

05:46.596 --> 05:47.930
We're outta here!

05:48.014 --> 05:48.890
After them!

05:48.973 --> 05:50.308
You won't get away!

05:51.768 --> 05:53.019
Who even are you guys?

05:54.062 --> 05:55.271
Shit!

05:58.900 --> 06:00.234
DAN, INC.

06:00.318 --> 06:01.861
Where's the girl?

06:02.445 --> 06:04.572
It seems she's slipped away...

06:05.198 --> 06:07.700
She had two men helping her escape.

06:07.784 --> 06:09.827
We're looking into who they are.

06:10.745 --> 06:13.122
You let her get away again?

06:13.206 --> 06:14.290
CEO OF DAN, INC.

06:14.373 --> 06:18.753
We killed her entire clan
tracking her down!

06:18.836 --> 06:22.298
If she disappears,
it'll all have been for nothing!

06:22.381 --> 06:23.716
You idiot!

06:24.300 --> 06:25.802
I'm terribly sorry, sir!

06:25.885 --> 06:27.220
Enough!

06:27.303 --> 06:28.554
Get out of my sight!

06:30.431 --> 06:31.641
Send them in.

06:31.724 --> 06:32.850
Yes--

06:41.234 --> 06:46.322
Look, Son Hee,
his head is still gasping for air!

06:46.906 --> 06:48.407
You fool...

06:48.491 --> 06:50.618
We don't play with dead bodies.

06:50.701 --> 06:53.329
It's tasteless, Bacho.

06:54.580 --> 06:56.582
<i>These brothers are psychotic...</i>

06:56.666 --> 06:57.875
Listen to me.

06:57.959 --> 07:00.962
What we need is that girl's key.

07:01.045 --> 07:02.922
Once we have that key,

07:03.005 --> 07:05.258
we will be able
to rule all of the black market!

07:05.341 --> 07:08.052
I don't care what it takes. Find the girl!

07:08.136 --> 07:12.056
That means we can kill anyone
that gets in our way, correct?

07:13.057 --> 07:14.392
Do what you want.

07:17.854 --> 07:18.855
What?!

07:18.938 --> 07:20.648
You're the daughter of a mafia family?

07:20.731 --> 07:23.484
And not just any mafia family,
but the Lu clan?

07:23.568 --> 07:25.278
Don't announce it to the whole world!

07:25.361 --> 07:27.488
What do they want from you?

07:28.948 --> 07:30.741
This little guy.

07:30.825 --> 07:31.742
A key?

07:31.826 --> 07:34.787
The key to our clan's hidden vault.

07:34.871 --> 07:36.414
My parents trusted me with it.

07:36.497 --> 07:39.125
Screw that, just get rid of it.

07:39.208 --> 07:40.960
Nothing's worth your own life.

07:41.586 --> 07:43.087
No way in hell!

07:45.089 --> 07:46.215
My dad and mom

07:47.258 --> 07:49.218
died protecting this key.

07:53.973 --> 07:56.225
Shaotang, you go on ahead!

07:57.185 --> 07:59.103
Run! Hurry!

08:06.777 --> 08:08.988
If I let those guys get this now,

08:09.697 --> 08:12.408
how can I face my parents in heaven?

08:13.826 --> 08:17.246
Oh, I got carried away.
This isn't your problem.

08:17.330 --> 08:19.123
Sorry for the trouble!

08:22.502 --> 08:24.045
I guess this is goodbye.

08:25.546 --> 08:28.591
Do you know how to make
an authentic pork bun?

08:29.175 --> 08:31.135
Huh? A pork bun?

08:31.719 --> 08:36.432
Well, my dad taught me the basics,
so I guess I could.

08:36.516 --> 08:39.977
Mr. Sakamoto, don't get involved in this!

08:40.061 --> 08:42.188
I have a bad feeling about her.

08:42.271 --> 08:44.690
Cancel today's shopping trip.

08:45.525 --> 08:46.943
We're going to save this girl.

08:48.528 --> 08:52.615
But you have to make us pork buns
once we get you back alive.

08:52.698 --> 08:54.075
Do we have a deal?

08:54.158 --> 08:56.744
The heck? Are you two...

08:58.412 --> 08:59.372
Mr. Sakamoto!

09:08.256 --> 09:09.674
Mr. Sakamoto!

09:09.757 --> 09:12.134
They caught up while we were yakking.

09:12.718 --> 09:13.678
Also,

09:14.345 --> 09:16.597
the situation just got a lot worse.

09:17.640 --> 09:21.686
Bacho, I keep telling you,
your hits are in bad taste.

09:21.769 --> 09:26.566
Oh, shut up.
There's no "taste" in hits to begin with.

09:26.649 --> 09:29.277
We see, we kill.

09:29.360 --> 09:32.321
If you want,
we can line up their dead bodies all nice.

09:32.405 --> 09:35.408
I'm talking about the way you kill.

09:35.908 --> 09:38.327
It's like I'm talking to a baboon.

09:38.411 --> 09:40.288
What's with these guys?

09:40.371 --> 09:42.540
Son Hee and Bacho.

09:42.623 --> 09:44.166
They're twin hit men.

09:45.084 --> 09:49.046
<i>They charge an absurd amount of money,
but never miss their target.</i>

09:49.130 --> 09:52.925
<i>They're serial killers that find joy
in slaughtering people.</i>

09:53.009 --> 09:56.304
<i>They make sketches of
their victims' heads as a hobby.</i>

09:56.387 --> 09:57.763
<i>They're insane!</i>

09:57.847 --> 10:00.600
I guess we're famous now.

10:00.683 --> 10:02.310
Isn't that nice, Son Hee?

10:02.393 --> 10:03.644
You moron.

10:03.728 --> 10:05.271
We're hit men.

10:05.354 --> 10:07.440
We should be ashamed
that we're drawing attention.

10:07.523 --> 10:09.650
Yeah, you should be ashamed!

10:11.694 --> 10:14.739
Are you mad 'cause we killed your friend?

10:14.822 --> 10:17.116
Looks like Lu's
not the only little girl here.

10:17.199 --> 10:19.410
You think you killed my friend?

10:19.952 --> 10:21.579
You must be pretty dumb.

10:24.040 --> 10:27.627
Only an amateur hit man
wouldn't know Taro Sakamoto.

10:28.294 --> 10:29.879
Talk while you can, kid.

10:51.692 --> 10:52.985
Son of a...

10:53.611 --> 10:55.237
Who are you?

11:00.576 --> 11:02.870
<i>Red bean buns would be nice too.</i>

11:14.673 --> 11:15.966
<i>Where are we?</i>

11:17.301 --> 11:18.719
CLOSED

11:18.803 --> 11:22.598
That guy packs quite a punch.

11:22.681 --> 11:24.183
Don't you think, Bacho?

11:26.227 --> 11:28.229
The roof must have been rotting.

11:28.813 --> 11:30.940
I'm gonna destroy him.

11:31.023 --> 11:32.149
Little lady.

11:33.234 --> 11:37.405
Hand over the key now,
and I'll give you an elegant death.

11:37.488 --> 11:38.406
Deal?

11:38.489 --> 11:40.658
This is all I have left of my parents...

11:41.200 --> 11:43.661
I'll guard it with my life!

11:43.744 --> 11:45.663
Oh, my.

11:45.746 --> 11:49.500
Your parents said something like that
before I diced them up.

11:50.418 --> 11:51.836
What a shame.

11:51.919 --> 11:54.964
Obsessing over some object
over your own life?

11:55.047 --> 11:57.341
What terrible, terrible taste.

11:57.425 --> 11:58.426
Shut up!

11:59.135 --> 12:00.136
No!

12:04.640 --> 12:05.808
How dare you!

12:05.891 --> 12:09.186
Don't be dumb.
You can't let them get under your skin.

12:10.646 --> 12:15.985
That vault contains all my ancestors'
wishes and hopes for generations.

12:16.652 --> 12:18.446
Dad died protecting that.

12:19.113 --> 12:20.656
Killed by these assholes...

12:20.739 --> 12:21.866
Okay, then.

12:25.077 --> 12:27.079
Come on now, don't get in our way!

12:27.663 --> 12:31.333
She was so close to seeing her
beloved parents again.

12:31.417 --> 12:35.463
No one has the right
to tell others what's important or not.

12:38.549 --> 12:39.884
Why...

12:39.967 --> 12:43.345
Why are you risking your life to help me?

12:54.815 --> 12:56.442
You're covered in blood again...

12:57.276 --> 12:58.903
I had work...

12:59.487 --> 13:02.490
"Work"? I think you mean "murder"!

13:02.573 --> 13:04.533
How can you do something like that?

13:05.618 --> 13:08.120
I had to work
so I could buy you a present...

13:08.204 --> 13:11.540
I don't want it. You're handing it to me
with literal blood on your hands!

13:14.293 --> 13:15.628
That's it.

13:17.963 --> 13:20.591
If you can't change your ways,

13:20.674 --> 13:21.800
I guess...

13:23.260 --> 13:24.470
we can't be together.

13:25.513 --> 13:26.388
Bye-bye.

13:35.814 --> 13:37.191
- Someone fell!
- What?!

13:43.948 --> 13:46.200
That was a longer drop than I thought.

13:46.325 --> 13:48.577
Thank goodness for this snow!

13:50.329 --> 13:51.580
See?

13:51.664 --> 13:56.210
You'd miss me if I died, wouldn't you?

13:57.336 --> 13:58.212
Don't you get it?

13:58.295 --> 14:01.715
The feeling that made you want to save me

14:01.799 --> 14:05.469
is shared by every person out there.
Everyone is loved by someone.

14:06.929 --> 14:09.348
So please, promise me...

14:13.727 --> 14:15.437
you won't kill anymore.

14:16.188 --> 14:17.898
That's our rule.

14:18.607 --> 14:20.651
To make up for
all the people you've killed,

14:20.734 --> 14:21.944
from here on out,

14:23.028 --> 14:25.364
spend your life saving people instead.

14:31.620 --> 14:33.122
The bleeding's stopped.

14:33.831 --> 14:36.041
No kill rule. Got it, Shin?

14:36.876 --> 14:38.586
Yes, Mr. Sakamoto!

14:38.669 --> 14:41.547
Get over yourselves, you amateurs!

14:56.854 --> 14:57.688
Take this!

15:15.831 --> 15:17.666
You've got some moves.

15:20.628 --> 15:23.172
Bacho, you thinking what I'm thinking?

15:23.255 --> 15:25.925
I sure am, Brother. Let's do it!

15:31.221 --> 15:33.098
Cast-iron Technique,

15:33.641 --> 15:35.059
Slashes of Hell!

15:37.436 --> 15:39.480
We'll turn you into mincemeat!

15:43.442 --> 15:44.360
What?

15:45.736 --> 15:47.738
Are you okay, Mr. Sakamoto?

15:47.821 --> 15:49.490
<i>I think I pulled a muscle.</i>

15:50.074 --> 15:51.617
Here, a pain relief patch.

15:51.700 --> 15:55.162
<i>Did he... dodge all that?</i>

15:55.245 --> 15:57.831
<i>But Slashes of Hell is inescapable!</i>

15:57.915 --> 15:59.833
<i>Not to mention how big he is.</i>

15:59.917 --> 16:02.044
<i>How can it be?
There's not a single scratch on him!</i>

16:03.128 --> 16:05.756
Bacho, you thinking what I'm thinking?

16:05.839 --> 16:08.133
I sure am, Brother. Let's do it!

16:09.468 --> 16:12.346
You're the third person to witness this!

16:14.014 --> 16:15.683
Cast-iron Technique!

16:22.272 --> 16:23.774
You bastard!

16:28.153 --> 16:31.740
<i>My enhanced-strength chakram!</i>

16:31.824 --> 16:33.534
<i>Who is this man?</i>

16:37.246 --> 16:39.915
<i>I'm not used to that kind of weight.</i>

16:39.999 --> 16:40.874
<i>Ouch.</i>

16:41.000 --> 16:43.043
Here, Mr. Sakamoto, for your hand.

16:43.127 --> 16:46.755
<i>Damn it! Forget these two.</i>

16:47.464 --> 16:49.133
<i>I'll just get the girl!</i>

16:49.216 --> 16:51.093
I heard that!

16:59.768 --> 17:01.437
COOL IMPACT
REFRIGERATOR SMASH!!

17:10.821 --> 17:14.074
Seriously, who are you two?

17:18.871 --> 17:20.581
Just a couple of retail workers.

17:22.583 --> 17:25.711
I don't get you one bit.

17:25.794 --> 17:29.465
Damn it! Where's Bacho and Son Hee?

17:29.548 --> 17:32.384
There's treasure right behind these doors!

17:33.052 --> 17:36.555
All I need is that key. That little key!

17:36.638 --> 17:37.848
Delivery!

17:40.601 --> 17:42.352
Bacho! Son Hee!

17:43.228 --> 17:45.022
Who the hell are you?

17:45.105 --> 17:46.940
What did you do to my guards--

17:47.024 --> 17:48.108
Shut it.

17:48.192 --> 17:49.359
Don't say a word.

17:49.443 --> 17:51.445
You!

17:52.988 --> 17:55.032
Sorry! I'm sorry!

17:55.115 --> 17:57.910
I'll do anything! Please!

17:57.993 --> 18:01.205
"Sorry" won't bring back my parents!

18:01.830 --> 18:03.665
Get ready to repent in hell!

18:12.841 --> 18:14.718
Are you sure that's enough?

18:14.802 --> 18:16.845
Maybe a couple extra blows--

18:19.848 --> 18:22.142
Stop killing me in your mind!

18:22.226 --> 18:24.103
<i>Stay out of it.</i>

18:26.772 --> 18:28.107
It's enough.

18:30.275 --> 18:33.612
You can't go around killing people
every time they upset you.

18:33.695 --> 18:36.323
"Choose to live a happy life."

18:36.406 --> 18:37.866
That's what Dad always said.

18:43.413 --> 18:45.624
Anytime now, pink hair.

18:45.749 --> 18:48.293
Can it, rude guy!

18:48.377 --> 18:51.004
I have a name and it's Lu Shaotang.

18:51.630 --> 18:54.258
This key is so old, it's not turning.

18:57.427 --> 18:58.887
Now we're talking!

18:58.971 --> 19:00.097
What's inside?

19:00.180 --> 19:02.141
Hey, I should go in first!

19:03.851 --> 19:07.187
Whoa! Look at all the treasure!

19:08.355 --> 19:11.191
And books? CDs? Plushies?

19:11.900 --> 19:13.527
What a weird collection...

19:14.278 --> 19:16.613
Look, an inventory.

19:18.365 --> 19:19.741
Let's see.

19:19.825 --> 19:25.455
"The head of the Lu clan shall leave
their most treasured items in this vault."

19:25.539 --> 19:28.834
I guess each clan head
considers different things treasure.

19:29.585 --> 19:31.211
I wonder what my dad left.

19:38.635 --> 19:39.761
What does it say?

19:40.721 --> 19:44.433
<i>"Something to drink with Shaotang
when she's of age."</i>

19:46.310 --> 19:47.853
<i>That's so Dad.</i>

19:48.854 --> 19:51.481
Come on. What does it say?

19:53.442 --> 19:56.737
It says it's the best liquor on Earth!

19:57.237 --> 19:59.239
Have some! A sign of my gratitude.

20:01.074 --> 20:03.285
It better be good stuff!

20:05.954 --> 20:09.124
Mr. Sakamoto, you held on to these?

20:09.208 --> 20:12.044
What are these? Why are they all smashed?

20:12.127 --> 20:14.004
Because of you.

20:14.630 --> 20:16.465
<i>They still taste good, though.</i>

20:21.970 --> 20:24.640
Japanese pork buns aren't half bad.

21:56.606 --> 21:59.067
<i>Yesterday, in Niikita Chinatown,</i>

21:59.151 --> 22:03.071
<i>what is believed to be a gang fight
between mafia members broke out.</i>

22:03.155 --> 22:04.072
<i>Witnesses say--</i>

22:04.156 --> 22:05.741
Good morning!

22:05.824 --> 22:07.409
<i>Too loud.</i>

22:07.492 --> 22:10.037
<i>Headache, hungover...</i>

22:11.163 --> 22:13.206
Here, drink this, Mr. Sakamoto.

22:13.290 --> 22:14.333
MIKAN JUICE

22:14.416 --> 22:15.500
Welcome--

22:16.376 --> 22:18.587
Boss, this apron fits perfect.

22:18.670 --> 22:20.672
What are you doing here?

22:20.756 --> 22:24.259
I don't have a job.
I'm gonna make authentic pork buns here.

22:24.343 --> 22:27.054
But you've got all that treasure!

22:27.137 --> 22:30.932
I'm not using my family heirlooms.
Are you dense?

22:31.641 --> 22:32.768
What did you say?!

22:32.851 --> 22:34.478
Simple-minded?

22:34.561 --> 22:37.105
<i>Please... be quiet.</i>

22:37.189 --> 22:41.151
By the way,
I was really moved by your story.

22:41.234 --> 22:43.487
You know, the reason you stopped killing.

22:44.279 --> 22:45.238
<i>How do you know?</i>

22:46.531 --> 22:49.326
When we were fighting those creeps,

22:49.409 --> 22:52.370
I saw the memory
you were thinking of, and...

22:54.081 --> 22:56.416
You're one of us now. It's your rule, too.

22:56.500 --> 22:57.417
SAKAMOTO FAMILY RULES

22:58.668 --> 22:59.628
Yes, sir.

23:03.173 --> 23:06.134
"Rule number one. Do not kill people."

23:06.218 --> 23:07.928
<i>I'll kill you if you do.</i>

23:08.011 --> 23:09.805
That contradicts your own rule!

23:15.560 --> 23:17.521
From the JAA.

23:17.604 --> 23:18.605
WANTED

23:18.688 --> 23:22.567
The bounty on this fat-ass is...

23:22.651 --> 23:24.194
one billion yen.

23:24.277 --> 23:25.821
Subtitle translation by: Yuka Kristi
